== Errata ==

Transient behavior is noted in the MX8330MC datasheet.

<blockquote>
'''Note (MX8330MC Rev. E):''' Because the VCO and the counter in the FEEDBACK DIVIDER cannot operate in accordance with each other in the initial stage, the counter must be reset if the power-on voltage is less than 3.3V. This is achieved by toggling the '''FSEL''' pin after VDD exceeds 3.0V. It takes 5ms for the signal to stabilize after toggling.
</blockquote>

